Hell yeah!

00:18:07.640 --> 00:18:10.400
Let's go, you guys.

00:18:10.400 --> 00:18:12.360
Okay, boss.

00:18:12.730 --> 00:18:14.150
Anytime.

00:18:14.650 --> 00:18:18.530
Come on perfect Mega-Neus!

00:18:24.370 --> 00:18:25.710
W-What!?

00:18:35.010 --> 00:18:38.260
What color do you bleed?!

00:18:38.260 --> 00:18:42.640
Everyone...everyone should disappear!

00:18:48.850 --> 00:18:51.190
Oh! Intense!

00:19:01.490 --> 00:19:03.040
Is everyone okay?

00:19:03.040 --> 00:19:03.950
Yes.

00:19:04.900 --> 00:19:06.500
I'm here.

00:19:07.750 --> 00:19:08.810
What a relief.

00:19:12.750 --> 00:19:16.830
You sure did a number on us, magician.

00:19:16.830 --> 00:19:19.210
Eh? But we never did anything.

00:19:19.210 --> 00:19:21.820
Shut up! Shut up!

00:19:22.830 --> 00:19:26.380
Anyway, I will at least get my payback.

00:19:26.380 --> 00:19:27.550
Since this job...

00:19:27.550 --> 00:19:29.560
...will be over if we are underestimated.

00:19:30.000 --> 00:19:32.360
Appear, Band of Eight!

00:19:34.530 --> 00:19:35.520
What's this?

00:19:37.320 --> 00:19:38.190
Barrier!

00:19:46.210 --> 00:19:47.700
Takuto!

00:19:51.300 --> 00:19:52.920
What is this?

00:19:54.220 --> 00:19:58.670
It's the basics of combat to finish off the weakest one first.

00:19:59.760 --> 00:20:00.670
Suzuho!

00:20:00.670 --> 00:20:01.450
The ribbon.

00:20:01.450 --> 00:20:02.880
Take the ribbon off!

00:20:10.730 --> 00:20:12.280
Your magic doesn't disappear.

00:20:12.690 --> 00:20:16.430
Oh, our powers aren't magic.

00:20:18.280 --> 00:20:19.620
Supernatural powers.

00:20:19.900 --> 00:20:21.250
Supernatural powers?

00:20:22.340 --> 00:20:23.320
Oh no!

00:20:25.240 --> 00:20:29.360
With psychological induction, being able to produce impossible objects...

00:20:29.360 --> 00:20:31.120
Imagination embodiment ability.

00:20:31.830 --> 00:20:34.040
Being able to build a transport field...

00:20:34.040 --> 00:20:35.610
Teleportation ability.

00:20:36.100 --> 00:20:37.060
And this is...

00:20:37.060 --> 00:20:38.880
Psychokinesis!

00:20:42.800 --> 00:20:44.930
Now what will you do?

00:20:45.300 --> 00:20:50.330
If you guys accept to use your magical powers for us,

00:20:50.600 --> 00:20:53.850
I might rethink.

00:20:55.190 --> 00:20:57.310
Since it's a prized power,

00:20:57.310 --> 00:21:02.150
shouldn't we use it to have a fun and crazy life?

00:21:02.360 --> 00:21:03.770
You're wrong.

00:21:03.770 --> 00:21:04.540
Huh?

00:21:05.200 --> 00:21:06.400
That isn't right.

00:21:07.120 --> 00:21:08.880
Magic to me is...

00:21:09.470 --> 00:21:10.290
Magic is...

00:21:10.540 --> 00:21:11.910
What?

00:21:12.200 --> 00:21:13.730
Just something different.

00:21:14.440 --> 00:21:15.610
It's different.

00:21:16.560 --> 00:21:18.890
Seems that's it.

00:21:20.060 --> 00:21:23.600
Then...do as you want!

00:21:31.930 --> 00:21:34.100
Takuto...

00:21:36.100 --> 00:21:37.170
Tanarotte!

00:22:10.260 --> 00:22:13.290
The water droplets bounced
mizutama no shizuku ga hanete

00:22:13.620 --> 00:22:16.700
a sky colored rythem glitters.
sorairo no rizumu kirari

00:22:17.160 --> 00:22:19.880
Follow the tri-colored cat
fukafuka mikeneko ni tsuzuke

00:22:19.880 --> 00:22:22.850
going on a walk.
sanpo ni deyou

00:22:22.850 --> 00:22:27.170
Yes, the direction of the fish's tears
sousa sakana no namida no yukue mo

00:22:27.170 --> 00:22:30.510
the rainbow connecting the sky and the city
sora to machi wo tsunagu niji mo

00:22:30.510 --> 00:22:33.550
This world overfilling with questions,
nazonazo ni afureru sekai wo

00:22:33.550 --> 00:22:39.740
shall I take a bite out of it?
hitokuchi tabete miru kana

00:22:41.050 --> 00:22:43.890
