hachimitsu no yume kajitte

00:22:43.890 --> 00:22:48.840
and keep half of it in my pocket,
poketto ni hanbun shimatara

00:22:48.840 --> 00:22:54.280
happiness, I realize the sweetness.
happiness sono amasa ni mezameru

00:22:54.820 --> 00:22:57.740
Chasing the jet trail,
hikouki gumo oikakete

