the far flying humming
tooku tondeiku humming wa

00:23:02.650 --> 00:23:10.790
is a pastel resounding melody.
pasuteru ni hibiku melodi-

00:23:11.210 --> 00:23:14.280
Mu-Mu-Music
myu myu music

00:23:14.720 --> 00:23:17.770
Sun-Sun-Sunshine
sun sun sunshine

00:23:18.050 --> 00:23:21.120
Mu-Mu-Music
myu myu music

00:23:25.870 --> 00:23:29.460
The school we go to everyday...

00:23:30.100 --> 00:23:31.890
The regular days that don't change...

00:23:31.890 --> 00:23:33.940
The repeating days...

00:23:33.940 --> 00:23:35.470
Keep going on as usual...

00:23:36.300 --> 00:23:38.830
I am alone...
